        <p class="eyebrow mono">Greg Toler &middot; GT Strategies</p>
        <h1>Go-to-Market and Operations&nbsp;Support</h1>
        <div class="seam" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <p class="lede">Strategy, systems, and hands-on execution for teams that need it fixed, built, or scaled.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="splash-btn primary" href="https://gregtoler.com/#contact" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <span class="node-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span>
            <span>Work with me</span>
          </a>
          <a class="splash-btn ghost" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/gregtoler" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <span>Connect on LinkedIn</span>
            <svg class="ext" width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 02 the framework -->
    <section class="slide s-map" data-name="The framework">
      <div class="map-grid">
        <div class="map-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow mono">What I do</p>
          <h2>Go-to-market and operations, strategy through execution</h2>
          <p>I help companies fix, build, and scale how they sell and how they run. The plan and the build, hands on, handed off so it runs without me.</p>
          <p>Every engagement sits somewhere on this map.</p>
          <a class="more mono" href="https://gregtoler.com/examples" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">All the examples at gregtoler.com/examples &rarr;</a>
        </div>
        <div class="plane-wrap">
          <div class="plane" id="plane" data-mode="grid">
            <div class="ax-h" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="ax-v" aria-hidden="true"></div>

            <button class="axlab l-top" data-axis="y" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="panel-y">Strategy</button>
